# Cloudflare Pages — proxy para a API (mesma origem, sem CORS)
# Troque https://ygo-card-maker-api.onrender.com pela URL do seu deploy Docker.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

/api/*          https://ygo-card-maker-api.onrender.com/api/:splat        200
/c/*            https://ygo-card-maker-api.onrender.com/c/:splat          200
/static/*       https://ygo-card-maker-api.onrender.com/static/:splat     200
/media/*        https://ygo-card-maker-api.onrender.com/media/:splat      200
/docs           https://ygo-card-maker-api.onrender.com/docs              200
/openapi.json   https://ygo-card-maker-api.onrender.com/openapi.json      200
/health         https://ygo-card-maker-api.onrender.com/health            200

# SPA fallback (precisa ser a última regra)
/*              /index.html                                                200
